keywordHead	A deck can have any number of cards named CARDNAME.
keywordHead	Affinity
keywordHead	Afflict
keywordHead	After you roll a die, you may pay 1 life. If you do, increase or decrease the result by 1. Do this only once each turn.
keywordHead	After you roll a die, you may remove a +1/+1 counter from Xenosquirrels. If you do, increase or decrease the result by 1.
keywordHead	Afterlife
keywordHead	Aftermath
keywordHead	All creatures able to block CARDNAME do so.
keywordHead	AlternateAdditionalCost
keywordHead	Amplify
keywordHead	Annihilator
keywordHead	As an additional cost to cast creature spells, you may pay any amount of mana. If you do, that creature enters with that many additional +1/+1 counters on it.
keywordHead	Ascend
keywordHead	Assist
keywordHead	Aura swap
keywordHead	Awaken
keywordHead	Backup
keywordHead	Banding
keywordHead	Bands with other
keywordHead	Bargain
keywordHead	Battle cry
keywordHead	Beam me up
keywordHead	Before drawing your opening hand, choose 1, 2, or 3.
keywordHead	Bestow
keywordHead	Blitz
keywordHead	Bloodthirst
keywordHead	Bushido
keywordHead	Buyback
keywordHead	CARDNAME can be your commander.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can block creatures with shadow as though they didn't have shadow.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can only attack alone.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can't attack alone.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can't attack or block alone.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can't attack or block.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can't attack unless a black or green creature also attacks.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can't attack unless a creature with greater power also attacks.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can't attack unless at least two other creatures attack.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can't be destroyed by lethal damage unless lethal damage dealt by a single source is marked on it.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can't block alone.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can't block unless a creature with greater power also blocks.
keywordHead	CARDNAME can't block unless at least two other creatures block.
